{"sha": "3dc5e7723798f3f714e8970e4ae42379e1767e9aed117e96f9f6949b19750a03", "body": ["\\textbf{8.} (i) 控制收敛定理把第 2 题中的逐点极限", "化为积分的收敛，所用控制函数取自第 3 题。", "(ii) 高斯积分计算出极限", "$\\int\\eu^{-u^2/2} = \\sqrt{2\\pi}$ --- 斯特林常数", "$\\sqrt{2\\pi}$ \\emph{正是}高斯积分。", "(iii) 代换 $x = t + \\sqrt tu$ 是一个仿射变量变换，", "其依据是平移不变性以及勒贝格测度的伸缩法则", "（\\cref{thm:b3:product:linearchange}，", "取维数 $1$ 的情形）。", "", "\\textbf{9.} 展开两项：", "\\[", "d_n - d_{n+1} = \\ln\\frac{n!}{(n+1)!} + \\Bigl(n +", "\\frac32\\Bigr)\\ln(n+1) - \\Bigl(n + \\frac12\\Bigr)\\ln n - 1", "= \\Bigl(n + \\frac12\\Bigr)\\ln\\frac{n+1}n - 1,", "\\]", "两项 $-\\ln(n+1)$ 与 $(n + \\frac32)\\ln(n+1)$ 合并成", "$(n + \\frac12)\\ln(n+1)$。", "", "\\textbf{10.} 取 $t = \\frac1{2n+1}$，则 $\\frac{1+t}{1-t} =", "\\frac{2n+2}{2n} = \\frac{n+1}n$，且 $n + \\frac12 =", "\\frac1{2t}$；奇幂级数 $\\ln\\frac{1+t}{1-t} =", "2\\sum_{k\\geq0}\\frac{t^{2k+1}}{2k+1}$ 给出", "\\[", "\\Bigl(n + \\frac12\\Bigr)\\ln\\frac{n+1}n", "= \\sum_{k\\geq0}\\frac{t^{2k}}{2k+1}", "= 1 + \\frac{t^2}3 + \\frac{t^4}5 + \\cdots", "\\]", "减去 $1$。下界：只取第一项，", "$\\frac{t^2}3 = \\frac1{3(2n+1)^2}$。上界：将所有分母降为", "$3$，并对等比级数求和：", "$\\frac{t^2}{3(1 - t^2)} = \\frac1{3((2n+1)^2 - 1)} =", "\\frac1{12n(n+1)} = \\frac1{12n} - \\frac1{12(n+1)}$.", "", "\\textbf{11.} 将上界从 $n$ 到 $\\infty$ 求和", "（用到 $d_m \\to 0$）得 $d_n < \\frac1{12n}$。下界：", "$\\frac1{12m+1} - \\frac1{12(m+1)+1} =", "\\frac{12}{(12m+1)(12m+13)}$，且", "\\begin{align*}", "\\frac1{3(2m+1)^2} > \\frac{12}{(12m+1)(12m+13)}", "&\\iff (12m+1)(12m+13) > 36(2m+1)^2 \\\\", "&\\iff 168m + 13 > 144m + 36,", "\\end{align*}", "对 $m \\geq 1$ 成立。对此可裂项相消的下界求和：", "$d_n > \\frac1{12n+1}$。取指数后得到经典的", "$n!$ 夹逼估计。", "", "\\textbf{12.} (a) 相对误差 $= \\eu^{d_n} - 1 <", "\\eu^{1/(12n)} - 1 < \\frac{1.1}{12n}$，当 $n$ 充分大时；$<", "10^{-6}$ 只要 $12n \\geq 1.1\\cdot10^6$，而所给的", "$n \\geq 83\\,334$ 即已足够（$\\frac1{12n} \\leq 10^{-6}$", "已蕴含它）。(b) $\\log_{10}(100!) =", "\\frac12\\log_{10}(200\\pi) + 200 - 100\\log_{10}\\eu +", "d_{100}\\log_{10}\\eu = 1.39906 + 200 - 43.42945 + 0.00036", "\\approx 157.96997$，故 $100! \\approx 10^{0.96997} \\cdot", "10^{157} = 9.333\\cdot10^{157}$；可保证的区间", "$(\\eu^{1/1201}, \\eu^{1/1200})$ 的相对宽度", "小于 $10^{-6}$ --- 所谓“渐近”公式，在 $n =", "100$ 时却是一件精密的工具。", "", "\\textbf{13.} 写 $\\sin^n = \\sin^{n-2} - \\sin^{n-2}\\cos^2$，", "并对第二项分部积分（取 $u = \\cos\\theta$，", "$\\dd v = \\sin^{n-2}\\cos\\theta\\,\\dd\\theta$，$v =", "\\frac{\\sin^{n-1}}{n-1}$）：", "\\[", "\\int_0^{\\pi/2}\\sin^{n-2}\\cos^2 =", "\\Bigl[\\cos\\theta\\,\\frac{\\sin^{n-1}\\theta}{n-1}\\Bigr]_0^{\\pi/2}", "+ \\frac1{n-1}\\int_0^{\\pi/2}\\sin^n = \\frac{W_n}{n-1} .", "\\]", "于是 $W_n = W_{n-2} - \\frac{W_n}{n-1}$，即 $W_n =", "\\frac{n-1}nW_{n-2}$。由 $W_0 = \\frac\\pi2$，$W_1 = 1$ 可得：", "\\[", "W_{2n} = \\frac{(2n-1)!!}{(2n)!!}\\cdot\\frac\\pi2", "= \\frac\\pi2\\binom{2n}n4^{-n},", "\\qquad", "W_{2n+1} = \\frac{(2n)!!}{(2n+1)!!}", "= \\frac{4^n}{(2n+1)\\binom{2n}n},", "\\]", "双阶乘的换算依据 $(2n)!! = 2^nn!$ 及", "$(2n-1)!! = \\frac{(2n)!}{2^nn!}$。最后 $nW_nW_{n-1} =", "(n-1)W_{n-1}W_{n-2}$ 由递推式知其为常数，且等于", "$1\\cdot W_1W_0 = \\frac\\pi2$。", "", "\\textbf{14.} $W_{2n+1} \\leq W_{2n} \\leq W_{2n-1}$（由 $\\sin^n$ 的逐点", "单调性），且 $\\frac{W_{2n-1}}{W_{2n+1}} =", "\\frac{2n+1}{2n} \\to 1$，夹逼得 $\\frac{W_{2n}}{W_{2n+1}} \\to", "1$。结合 $W_{2n}W_{2n+1} = \\frac{\\pi}{2(2n+1)}$", "（第 13 题）：$W_{2n}^2 \\sim \\frac\\pi{4n}$，故 $W_{2n} \\sim", "\\frac12\\sqrt{\\frac\\pi n}$，且 $\\binom{2n}n4^{-n} =", "\\frac2\\pi W_{2n} \\sim \\frac1{\\sqrt{\\pi n}}$。", "", "\\textbf{15.} 第 9--10 题从未用到该常数的值。", "令 $e_n = \\ln n! - (n+\\frac12)\\ln n + n$，则", "差 $e_n - e_{n+1}$ 落在 $\\bigl(0, \\frac1{12n} -", "\\frac1{12(n+1)}\\bigr)$ 中，故 $(e_n)$ 递减，而 $(e_n -", "\\frac1{12n})$ 递增：二者为相邻数列，", "收敛于公共极限 $\\ell$。于是 $n! \\sim K n^{n+1/2}\\eu^{-n}$，$K =", "\\eu^\\ell$。", "", "\\textbf{16.} 将含未知常数的斯特林公式代入", "中心二项式：", "\\[", "\\binom{2n}n4^{-n}\\sqrt n \\sim", "\\frac{K\\,(2n)^{2n+1/2}\\eu^{-2n}}{\\bigl(K\\,n^{n+1/2}", "\\eu^{-n}\\bigr)^2}\\,4^{-n}\\sqrt n", "= \\frac{2^{2n}\\sqrt{2}\\,K\\,n^{2n+1/2}}{K^2\\,n^{2n+1}}", "\\,4^{-n}\\sqrt n = \\frac{\\sqrt2}{K},", "\\]", "由第 14 题可得 $\\frac{\\sqrt2}K = \\frac1{\\sqrt\\pi}$，", "即 $K = \\sqrt{2\\pi}$。第 III--IV 部分由此", "从头重证斯特林公式；将其代入第 I 部分的恒等式，", "算出 $\\int_\\R\\eu^{-u^2/2}\\dd u = \\sqrt{2\\pi}$，无需", "借助极坐标：沃利斯与高斯相互印证。", ""]}